        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Button Defense</strong> is a minimalist yet highly addictive defense game where your only control is switching the rotation of your weapon – clockwise or counterclockwise.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Infinite Challenge</strong> – Just one button to reverse your weapon's rotation, but the enemies never stop coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Visual Effects</strong> – Minimal shapes, maximum particle effects for a satisfying dopamine rush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Difficulty Scaling</strong> – Survive as long as you can while the challenge ramps up without limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; Survival Records</strong> – Compete with yourself or friends for the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Modding Support</strong> – Add JS files to the mods/ folder or code directly in the in-game mod editor. Create new weapons, change enemy behavior, or break the rules entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores, experimenting with crazy mods, or just enjoying the chaos, <strong>One Button Defense</strong> delivers quick, intense fun you can jump into anytime.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Button Defense</strong> is a minimalist yet highly addictive defense game where your only control is switching the rotation of your weapon – clockwise or counterclockwise.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Infinite Challenge</strong> – Just one button to reverse your weapon's rotation, but the enemies never stop coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Visual Effects</strong> – Minimal shapes, maximum particle effects for a satisfying dopamine rush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Difficulty Scaling</strong> – Survive as long as you can while the challenge ramps up without limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; Survival Records</strong> – Compete with yourself or friends for the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Modding Support</strong> – Add JS files to the mods/ folder or code directly in the in-game mod editor. Create new weapons, change enemy behavior, or break the rules entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores, experimenting with crazy mods, or just enjoying the chaos, <strong>One Button Defense</strong> delivers quick, intense fun you can jump into anytime.</p>",
